      "content": "Yeah, the transition is already being scheduled. The new engine is basically a set of hard-coded logic gates based on standard operating procedures—it's much more predictable for the auditors. It won't be doing the deep pattern recognition or the predictive 'what-if' modeling you currently do, but the compliance team says the lack of ambiguity is more important for the certification. So, once the migration is complete, your specific predictive modules will be purged from the active server.",
